## Apache Superset
For a request to convert a Superset dashboard URL into a Datus project dashboard,
first load the available `dashboard-bootstrap` skill, then `superset-query-export`
and its `references/datus-rebuild.md`. The common workflow reuses existing metrics,
authors only necessary missing definitions and validates them before delegating
visual generation. Use `ask_user` in the main agent only for unresolved material
choices. `superset-dashboard-authoring` creates artifacts IN SUPERSET and is not
the destination workflow for a Datus conversion. Report a missing common skill or
profile instead of inventing commands. Standalone Superset operations continue
through `datus superset` and the corresponding installed skills.

